    "text": "By Mark Pitz ,\n20 hours ago In this Community Conversation, presented by Floyd County Medical Center, 95.1 The Bull’s Mark Pitz talks with Dixie Zeien, who is organizing a Golf Cart/UTV Parade this Thursday (07.02) evening in New Hampton to ride past various assisted living and nursing homes, as well as Comp Systems. For more information, contact Zeien at 319-240-9069. Read full article",
